sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User
    participant Frontend as Web / Telegram / Voice
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Agent as LangGraph Agent
    participant Tools as Tool Layer
    participant LLM as Azure OpenAI
    participant DB as SQLite / FAISS
    participant Ext as External APIs
    participant Scheduler as APScheduler

    User->>Frontend: Send message / speak / open dashboard
    Frontend->>API: Chat request or websocket audio stream
    API->>Agent: ask_agent(...) with session context
    Agent->>LLM: Reason about intent and next action
    LLM-->>Agent: Tool choice / response plan

    alt Needs a tool
        Agent->>Tools: Execute selected tool
        Tools->>DB: Read/write memory, schedules, docs, logs
        Tools->>Ext: Gmail / Calendar / Fit / Search / Telegram / Voice
        Ext-->>Tools: Data / result
        Tools-->>Agent: Tool output
        Agent->>LLM: Final synthesis with tool results
        LLM-->>Agent: Response text
    else No tool needed
        LLM-->>Agent: Direct response
    end

    Agent->>DB: Store message / metrics / memory
    Agent-->>API: Final response
    API-->>Frontend: Text / summary / voice reply

    Scheduler->>Agent: Trigger briefing job
    Agent->>Tools: Build summary from context/data
    Tools-->>Agent: Digest
    Agent->>Frontend: Push notification via Telegram